 faag: fileam:00000734: /* 
 faag: fileam:00000735:  * parse_next_line 
 faag: fileam:00000736:  * 
 faag: fileam:00000737:  * Given a buffer of data, extract the next data line from it and parse it 
 faag: fileam:00000738:  * to attributes according to the data format specifications. 
 faag: fileam:00000739:  * 
 faag: fileam:00000740:  * Returns: 
 faag: fileam:00000741:  * LINE_OK - line parsed successfully. 
 faag: fileam:00000742:  * LINE_ERROR - line was mal-formatted. error caught and handled. 
 faag: fileam:00000743:  * NEED_MORE_DATA - line not parsed all the way through. need more data. 
 faag: fileam:00000744:  * END_MARKER - saw line end marker. skip attr parsing, we're done. 
 faag: fileam:00000745:  */ 
 faag: fileam:00000746: static DataLineStatus parse_next_line(FileScanDesc scan) 
 faag: fileam:00000747: { 
 faag: fileam:00000748:  CopyState pstate = scan->fs_pstate; 
